The Hexagon sensor registry/config files in this directory (qcom-hexagon-fs)
are sourced from Gio's ROCKNIX/sensor-firmware project, which does the
groundwork of collecting the AYN Odin 3 (SM8750) Snapdragon Sensor Core
registry + calibration data:

    https://github.com/ROCKNIX/sensor-firmware

This odin3-sensors package builds on that data (base + AYN Odin 3 overlay,
merged) to bring up the SSC accel/gyro on ROCKNIX. All credit for the sensor
registry collection goes to Gio and the ROCKNIX community.
